  "title": "Patsy's Best Barbeque Beef",
  "description": "This rich and tangy sauce for barbeque beef is so simple to throw together, and lets your slow cooker do all the work for you. A large recipe that freezes well means next time you won't even have to wait!",
  "authors": [
    "Patsy Snyder Hennessey"
